      "updated": 1771974865101,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Single thread block computes 64x64\n64x64 tile A & 64x64 tile B should be copied\nIf a single thread computes 8x8:\n- 8x8 threads per thread block = 64 threads/block\n- Max blocks/SM = 2048 / 64 = 32 blocks/SM => Nice!\n- Shared memory: 64 x 64 x 4byte x 2 = 32KB => Nice!\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Single thread block computes 64x64\n64x64 tile A & 64x64 tile B should be copied\nIf a single thread computes 8x8:\n- 8x8 threads per thread block = 64 threads/block\n- Max blocks/SM = 2048 / 64 = 32 blocks/SM => Nice!\n- Shared memory: 64 x 64 x 4byte x 2 = 32KB => Nice!\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
